  "transcript": [
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Good day! I've loaded incident IC-2001 for Uniformes Delta. Tell me calmly what happened, with times and everything, and I'll log each thing as you say it. ",
      "t_start_ms": 1546,
      "t_end_ms": 11154
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "All right, I'm wrapped up at Uniformes Delta, heading out.",
      "t_start_ms": 12387,
      "t_end_ms": 15991
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 15992,
      "t_end_ms": 16387
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "It was the online store going down this morning.",
      "t_start_ms": 16387,
      "t_end_ms": 18791
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Log the incident report for me before I forget it all.",
      "t_start_ms": 19188,
      "t_end_ms": 21989
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Well, monitoring flagged at around 5:40 in the morning that the site wasn't responding.",
      "t_start_ms": 35488,
      "t_end_ms": 39990
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 39992,
      "t_end_ms": 40591
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "When I got there, the web server was up but stuck, with the disk nearly full.",
      "t_start_ms": 40591,
      "t_end_ms": 44592
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Cleaned out the old logs, tuned the memory, and it came back.",
      "t_start_ms": 44989,
      "t_end_ms": 48394
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 50538,
      "t_end_ms": 51435
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 51585,
      "t_end_ms": 51587
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 51587,
      "t_end_ms": 51893
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "The outage was",
      "t_start_ms": 51893,
      "t_end_ms": 53387
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 53387,
      "t_end_ms": 53390
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "The outage was flagged by monitoring at 5:40. That's the first one.",
      "t_start_ms": 53390,
      "t_end_ms": 56396
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 56401,
      "t_end_ms": 58081
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 58081,
      "t_end_ms": 58445
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 58445,
      "t_end_ms": 59005
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "That's it.",
      "t_start_ms": 60293,
      "t_end_ms": 60731
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 60731,
      "t_end_ms": 60993
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "That's it.",
      "t_start_ms": 60993,
      "t_end_ms": 60993
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 60997,
      "t_end_ms": 61490
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Got to the server room at 7:30, and at 8:45 the site was responding again.",
      "t_start_ms": 61490,
      "t_end_ms": 66996
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Well, the one that went down was the production web server.",
      "t_start_ms": 72794,
      "t_end_ms": 75795
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 75795,
      "t_end_ms": 76291
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "And the staging one never even noticed it stayed up all night.",
      "t_start_ms": 76291,
      "t_end_ms": 79495
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 81315,
      "t_end_ms": 82293
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 82293,
      "t_end_ms": 82693
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Production.",
      "t_start_ms": 83196,
      "t_end_ms": 83201
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "The one that went down, staging stayed up. That's why I say it never even noticed.",
      "t_start_ms": 85595,
      "t_end_ms": 89202
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Noted.  I've  got  the  production  web  server  as  the  affected  service.\n\n To  make  sure  I  have  the  timeline  right,  I  have:\n At  seven  thirty,  you  got  to  the  server  room,\n At  eight  forty-five, the site was responding again, Correct? ",
      "t_start_ms": 89202,
      "t_end_ms": 104258
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "That's it, production. And the Payments API also queued up because payments weren't going through even when the site came back up. I already tested it with a trial purchase and it's fine.",
      "t_start_ms": 105592,
      "t_end_ms": 116095
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 119147,
      "t_end_ms": 119661
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 119804,
      "t_end_ms": 120360
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Noted.  I've  also  added  the  Store  payment  gateway  API  as  an  affected  service.  ",
      "t_start_ms": 120503,
      "t_end_ms": 121097
